<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79121" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραχώρ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>retiring.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.2.12
			</span></i> (pl.) ; <i>recession</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				5.110
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>retiring from, giving up, surrender</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1127.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δανείου</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1171.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span> ; of a holding of land, <i>surrender</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβεῖν κατὰ -χώρησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.40
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				30.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span> : generally, <i>cession,
			withdrawalfrom</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς χώρας, τῆς
			ἀρχῆς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				58
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγεμονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.27
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἄλλων ἄλλοις</span>
			<i>surrender</i> of one point to one, another to another, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.24.10
			</span></i>.</div>
